UID:ep7aQ40ROpm1NJz5eZB75
SUMMARY:Monthly Lighthouse Book Club
DTSTAMP:20260803T120112Z
DTSTART:20260917T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Lighthouse Book Club \nThe Lighthouse Book Club is launching—a 
	new monthly gathering for readers who love stories\, conversation\, and sh
	ared perspective. \nJoin us on the second to last Thursday of each month f
	rom 4:00–5:00 PM in the Boardroom of Building 1\, for an engaging discussi
	on led by Fernando Espinoza\, who will host the club. \nAt each meeting\, 
	Book Club members will collectively choose the next month’s book\, ensurin
	g a rotating\, member-driven reading list. \nIf you are in need of help to
	 set up audio books on your phone\, assistance is available. You may email
	 Fernando Espinoza at fespinoza@houstonlighthouse.org for more information
	 \nSIGN UP HERE\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/lighthouse_book_clu
	b/2026-09-17/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/lighthouse_book_club/2026-09-17/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
